cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this formalization, please cite the accompanying paper and this repository."
title: "NumericalSemigroups: a Lean 4 / Mathlib formalization of kernel windows and density asymptotics for Huang's quadratic form"
abstract: >-
  A machine-checked (zero-`sorry`) Lean 4 development of the structural results of
  "A Linear Algorithm for Huang's Quadratic Form on Numerical Semigroups and Density
  Asymptotics": the sliding-window form for two generators, the breakpoint decomposition of
  the multi-generator quadratic form with the window bound w(n) <= sigma_n, and the density
  asymptotics w(n)/(2^n - 1) = o(P(n)).
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Flamandzki
    given-names: Artur
    email: flamandzki.artur@gmail.com
version: 0.1.0
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/Flaman55/NumericalSemigroups"
keywords:
  - Lean 4
  - Mathlib
  - numerical semigroups
  - quadratic form
  - inclusion-exclusion
  - density asymptotics
  - formal verification
references:
